<title>UK: BA half-year pretax profit up 9.3 percent.</title>
<headline>BA half-year pretax profit up 9.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)	     39.7		  vs  33.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.25		 vs   3.85</p>
<p> Pretax		   470		    vs 430</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts for half-year pre-tax profits were in a range of 449 to 480 million stg, and 4.2 to 4.5p for the dividend.  </p>
<p> Turnover		   4,394		vs 3,782</p>
<p> Operating profit	   512		vs   523</p>
<p> Depreciation charge	250		vs   227</p>
<p> Div pay date	     Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration	 November 18, 1996</p>
<p>THREE MONTHS TO SEPTEMBER 30  Shr (pence)		27.8		 vs    23.3</p>
<p> Pretax		    320		   vs   295</p>
<p> Turnover		2,291		   vs 2,125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
